# Hack Idea Roulette

A small web app that generates hackathon ideas. Spin to get a **problem**, a **technology** and a **twist**, lock the ones you like, and spin again.

**Live demo:** https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/hack-idea-roulette/

## Why I made it

I built this as my first GitHub project while preparing for HackJunction. I wanted to learn how to publish code, write a README and host a page for free.

## How to run it

No install needed. Download the repo and open `index.html` in your browser.

## Built with

- HTML, CSS and plain JavaScript (no frameworks)
- GitHub Pages for hosting

## Make it your own

The idea lists are at the top of the `<script>` in `index.html`. Add your own problems, technologies or twists.

